    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>28520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やつらも不死身じゃない。
人間が知恵を振り絞れば
必ず対抗手段が見つかるはずよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They're not immortal creatures. If we band all of our knowledge together, I'm sure we'll find the best way to exterminate them.</EnglishText>
