    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>28612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……強力な破壊力を持つ
炎雷爆薬を一般に公開するのは
賭けよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm taking a big risk by letting my heat-spark charges out of my own hands.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>28612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>強力な兵器は、新たな争いの
火種にもなるから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Powerful weapons only serve to fan the flames of war.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>28612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……けど今は、人間の理性を
信じるしかないわよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I suppose I have no choice but to believe in humanity.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>28612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;……
とうとうラピスのスピルーンを
取り返したのね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You've finally given Lapis her Spirune back, haven't you Ines?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>28612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アイザック先輩が残した
あの子を、どうか幸せに
してあげてね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please, let the child Isaac left behind live a happy life.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>28612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ふふふ、私が
言うまでもないと思うけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though I suppose you don't need me to tell you that.</EnglishText>
